        "stem": "Evaluate $6\\sqrt{\\frac13}$ by two table routes: route 1 looks up $\\sqrt{0.3333}$ and multiplies the reported root by $6$; route 2 first rewrites the exact expression as $\\sqrt{12}$ and looks it up. Which option gives the complete computed comparison and identifies the route needing fewer table/correction/rescaling operations?",
