        "limitations": [
          "Recognition of the complete result does not demonstrate an unprompted written derivation, full-table navigation or a written convenience explanation.",
          "A small supplementary transcription of the identified 2010 Bradis table replaces navigation in the historical full table; historical edition equivalence is not established.",
