        "source_solution": "Independently solved before options in source-solutions-AFFECTED-1.md. Positive r=sqrt(S/pi). The stated approximate decimal inputs give exact quotients 625/157=3.9808917... and 412/157=2.6242038..., which under the newly visible four-significant-figure policy become 3.981 and 2.624. The first uses row3.9/main8=1.995 and correction1=0. The second uses row2.6/main2=1.619 and correction4=1, giving 1.620. Thus radii are 1.995 cm and 1.620 cm. Area factors 4 and 1/25 imply radius factors 2 and 1/5.",
